+    // the fog, after the alpha test, on the colour (after Dolphin; the formula is
+    // what GXSetFog's A, B and C give): the eye distance ze from the depth Zs
+    // (24-bit), A / (B - (Zs >> B_SHF)) in perspective or A * Zs in an
+    // orthographic projection; f = clamp(ze - C); then the type's curve, and
+    // the colour moves toward the fog's by f in 1/256 steps
+    uint32_t fsel = bp[0xF1] >> 21 & 7;
+    if (fsel) {
+        s += "    {\n        int zs = clamp(int(gl_FragCoord.z * 16777216.0), 0, 16777215);\n";
